FORMAT: 1A

# 会话管理 API

用户与 AI Agent 之间的会话管理接口，包括会话的创建、查询、更新和删除操作。

**基础路径**: `/chat`

## 树形结构与分支机制

会话任务（Session Task）采用树形结构，并引入 Branch（分支）概念，类似 git 的分支机制。

- 每个 Task 记录父节点（`parent_task_id`）和 ltree 路径（`tree_path`），形成一棵树
- Branch 是一个指针，类似 git HEAD，指向当前叶子 Task
- 所有涉及消息的接口均支持 `branch_name` 参数来指定操作目标分支

# Group 会话

会话（Session）是用户与 AI Agent 交互的基本单位，每个会话包含多条消息。

## 会话列表 [/chat/sessions]

### 获取用户所有会话 [GET]

获取当前认证用户的所有会话列表。

+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body

            {
                "sessions": [
                    {
                        "id": "01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345",
                        "user_id": "01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012346",
                        "title": "会话标题",
                        "archived": false,
                        "created_at": "2024-01-01T00:00:00Z",
                        "updated_at": "2024-01-01T00:00:00Z"
                    }
                ]
            }

+ Response 500 (application/json)

            {
                "detail": "获取会话列表失败: 错误信息"
            }

## 创建会话 [/chat/sessions/create]

### 创建新会话或获取现有空会话 [POST]

检查用户最新创建的会话（created_by="user"），如果该会话没有消息则返回该会话，否则创建新会话。

+ Request (application/json)

    + Body

            {
                "title": "会话标题"
            }

+ Response 200 (application/json)

    返回已存在的空会话

    + Body

            {
                "session_uuid": "01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345",
                "created_new_session": false,
                "message": "会话获取成功"
            }

+ Response 201 (application/json)

    创建新会话成功

    + Body

            {
                "session_uuid": "01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345",
                "created_new_session": true,
                "message": "会话创建成功"
            }

+ Response 500 (application/json)

            {
                "detail": "创建会话失败: 错误信息"
            }

## 活跃任务 [/chat/sessions/active_task]

### 获取会话活跃任务 [POST]

获取指定会话中处于 pending 或 processing 状态的任务列表。可通过 `branch_name` 过滤特定分支的任务。

+ Request (application/json)

    + Body

            {
                "session_id": "01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345",
                "branch_name": "main"
            }

+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body

            {
                "session_id": "01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345",
                "has_active_task": true,
                "active_tasks": [
                    {
                        "id": "01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012346",
                        "status": "pending",
                        "branch_id": "01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012347",
                        "branch_name": "main",
                        "created_at": "2024-01-01T00:00:00Z",
                        "updated_at": "2024-01-01T00:00:00Z"
                    }
                ],
                "total_count": 1
            }

+ Response 404 (application/json)

            {
                "detail": "会话不存在或不属于当前用户"
            }

+ Response 500 (application/json)

            {
                "detail": "获取活跃任务失败: 错误信息"
            }

## 消息历史 [/chat/sessions/messages_history]

### 获取会话消息历史 [POST]

获取指定会话分支的消息历史。通过 `branch_name` 定位分支指针，沿树形路径收集所有 Task 上的消息。

+ Request (application/json)

    + Body

            {
                "session_id": "01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345",
                "branch_name": "main",
                "limit": 50,
                "max_seq_index": 100
            }

+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body

            {
                "session_id": "01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345",
                "messages": [
                    {
                        "role": "user",
                        "message": { "...用户消息对象..." }
                    },
                    {
                        "role": "assistant",
                        "message": { "...Agent消息对象..." }
                    }
                ]
            }

+ Response 400 (application/json)

            {
                "detail": "参数错误: 当限定最大序号时，请提供 limit 参数"
            }

+ Response 404 (application/json)

            {
                "detail": "会话不存在或不属于当前用户"
            }

## 发送消息 [/chat/send_message]

### 发送消息 [POST]

发送消息到指定会话，如果未指定会话则创建新会话。消息会自动关联到指定分支的 pending 任务；若分支不存在则自动创建。该接口不调用语言模型进行实际的响应。

+ Request (application/json)

    + Body

            {
                "message": "你好",
                "session_id": "01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345",
                "branch_name": "main"
            }

+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body

            {
                "session_uuid": "01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345",
                "message_uuid": "01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012348",
                "session_task_id": "01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012349",
                "created_new_session": false,
                "message": "消息发送成功"
            }

+ Response 404 (application/json)

            {
                "detail": "会话不存在或不属于当前用户"
            }

+ Response 500 (application/json)

            {
                "detail": "发送消息失败: 错误信息"
            }

## 处理未回复消息 [/chat/process_pending_messages]

### 处理未回复消息 [POST]

处理指定会话分支中还未被 AI 回复的消息。找到分支上 pending 状态的 Task，收集绑定到该 Task 的等待消息，更新状态并启动 AI 处理。

+ Request (application/json)

    + Body

            {
                "session_id": "01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345",
                "branch_name": "main"
            }

+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body

            {
                "session_id": "01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345",
                "session_task_id": "01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012349",
                "processed_messages_id": [
                    "01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012348"
                ],
                "total_processed": 1,
                "message": "未回复消息处理完成"
            }

+ Response 404 (application/json)

            {
                "detail": "没有待处理的消息"
            }

+ Response 409 (application/json)

            {
                "detail": "当前分支有正在处理的任务"
            }

+ Response 500 (application/json)

            {
                "detail": "处理未回复消息时发生错误: 错误信息"
            }

## 更新会话标题 [/chat/sessions/update_title]

### 更新会话标题 [POST]

更新指定会话的标题。

+ Request (application/json)

    + Body

            {
                "session_id": "01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345",
                "title": "新的会话标题"
            }

+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body

            {
                "message": "会话标题更新成功",
                "session_id": "01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345",
                "new_title": "新的会话标题"
            }

+ Response 404 (application/json)

            {
                "detail": "会话不存在或不属于当前用户"
            }

+ Response 500 (application/json)

            {
                "detail": "更新会话标题失败: 错误信息"
            }

## 删除会话 [/chat/delete_session]

### 批量删除会话 [POST]

批量删除指定的会话及其关联数据（包括分支、任务、消息等）。返回每个会话的删除结果详情。

+ Request (application/json)

    + Body

            {
                "session_ids": [
                    "01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345",
                    "01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012346"
                ]
            }

+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body

            {
                "total_requested": 2,
                "deleted_count": 1,
                "failed_count": 1,
                "results": [
                    {
                        "session_id": "01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345",
                        "success": true,
                        "reason": null
                    },
                    {
                        "session_id": "01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012346",
                        "success": false,
                        "reason": "会话不存在或不属于当前用户"
                    }
                ]
            }

+ Response 500 (application/json)

            {
                "detail": "删除会话失败: 错误信息"
            }

# Group 数据结构

## SessionResponse
+ id: `01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345` (string, required) - 会话 UUID
+ user_id: `01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012346` (string, required) - 用户 UUID
+ title: `会话标题` (string, required) - 会话标题
+ archived: `false` (boolean, required) - 是否已归档
+ created_at: `2024-01-01T00:00:00Z` (string, required) - 创建时间
+ updated_at: `2024-01-01T00:00:00Z` (string, required) - 更新时间

## SessionListResponse
+ sessions (array[SessionResponse], required) - 会话列表

## CreateSessionRequest
+ title: `未命名的会话` (string, optional) - 会话标题

## CreateSessionResponse
+ session_uuid: `01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345` (string, required) - 会话 UUID
+ created_new_session: `true` (boolean, required) - 是否创建了新会话
+ message: `会话创建成功` (string, required) - 操作消息

## UpdateSessionTitleRequest
+ session_id: `01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345` (string, required) - 会话 ID
+ title: `新的会话标题` (string, required) - 新的会话标题

## SendMessageRequest
+ message: `你好` (string, required) - 消息内容，最小长度 1
+ session_id: `01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345` (string, optional) - 会话 ID，如果为空则创建新会话
+ branch_name: `main` (string, optional) - 分支名称，默认为 main

## SendMessageResponse
+ session_uuid: `01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345` (string, required) - 会话 UUID
+ message_uuid: `01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012348` (string, required) - 消息 UUID
+ session_task_id: `01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012349` (string, optional) - 关联的会话任务 ID
+ created_new_session: `false` (boolean, required) - 是否创建了新会话
+ message: `消息发送成功` (string, required) - 操作消息

## ProcessPendingMessagesRequest
+ session_id: `01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345` (string, required) - 会话 ID
+ branch_name: `main` (string, optional) - 分支名称，默认为 main

## ProcessPendingMessagesResponse
+ session_id: `01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345` (string, required) - 会话 ID
+ session_task_id: `01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012349` (string, required) - 会话任务 ID
+ processed_messages_id (array[string], required) - 已处理的消息 ID 列表
+ total_processed: `1` (number, required) - 已处理消息总数
+ message: `未回复消息处理完成` (string, required) - 操作消息

## SessionMessageHistoryRequest
+ session_id: `01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345` (string, required) - 会话 ID
+ branch_name: `main` (string, optional) - 分支名称，默认为 main
+ limit: `50` (number, optional) - 返回消息数量限制
+ max_seq_index: `100` (number, optional) - 最大序号限制（需要同时提供 limit）

## SessionMessageHistoryResponse
+ session_id: `01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345` (string, required) - 会话 ID
+ messages (array[SessionMessageHistoryResponseItem], required) - 消息列表

## SessionMessageHistoryResponseItem
+ role: `user` (enum[string], required) - 消息角色
    + Members
        + `user` - 用户消息
        + `assistant` - AI 消息
+ message (object, required) - 消息内容对象

## GetActiveTaskRequest
+ session_id: `01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345` (string, required) - 会话 ID
+ branch_name: `main` (string, optional) - 分支名称，为 null 表示查询所有分支

## ActiveTaskInfo
+ id: `01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012346` (string, required) - 任务 ID
+ status: `pending` (enum[string], required) - 任务状态
    + Members
        + `pending` - 等待中
        + `processing` - 处理中
+ branch_id: `01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012347` (string, optional) - 所属分支 ID
+ branch_name: `main` (string, optional) - 所属分支名称
+ created_at: `2024-01-01T00:00:00Z` (string, required) - 创建时间
+ updated_at: `2024-01-01T00:00:00Z` (string, required) - 更新时间

## GetActiveTaskResponse
+ session_id: `01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345` (string, required) - 会话 ID
+ has_active_task: `true` (boolean, required) - 是否有活跃任务
+ active_tasks (array[ActiveTaskInfo], required) - 活跃任务列表
+ total_count: `1` (number, required) - 活跃任务总数

## DeleteSessionRequest
+ session_ids: `["01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345"]` (array[string], required) - 会话 ID 列表，至少包含一个

## DeleteSessionResult
+ session_id: `01945a1b-2c3d-4e5f-6789-abcdef012345` (string, required) - 会话 ID
+ success: `true` (boolean, required) - 是否删除成功
+ reason: `会话不存在或不属于当前用户` (string, optional) - 失败原因，成功时为 null

## DeleteSessionResponse
+ total_requested: `2` (number, required) - 请求删除的会话总数
+ deleted_count: `1` (number, required) - 成功删除的会话数
+ failed_count: `1` (number, required) - 删除失败的会话数
+ results (array[DeleteSessionResult], required) - 每个会话的删除结果

## Error
+ detail: `错误信息` (string, required) - 错误详情
